Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ах!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.97,Rubi,,0000,0000,0000,,На
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.97,Rubi,,0000,0000,0000,,Шабуыл
